      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inasmuch as many have undertaken to compile a narrative of the things which have been accomplished among us, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 1.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.2.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 2.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " just as they were delivered to us by those who from the beginning were eyewitnesses and ministers of the word, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " it seemed good to me also, having followed all things closely",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "accurately",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for some time past, to write an orderly account for you, most excellent The-ophilus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.20.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 20.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " that you may know the truth concerning the things of which you have been informed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.2.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 2.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.24.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chron 24.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.31.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Chron 31.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In the days of Herod, king of Judea, there was a priest named Zechariah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Greek",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zacharias",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of the division of Abijah; and he had a wife of the daughters of Aaron, and her name was Elizabeth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they were both righteous before God, walking in all the commandments and ordinances of the Lord blameless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they had no child, because Elizabeth was barren, and both were advanced in years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now while he was serving as priest before God when his division was on duty, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 30.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " according to the custom of the priesthood, it fell to him by lot to enter the temple of the Lord and burn incense. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the whole multitude of the people were praying outside at the hour of incense. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 2.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 5.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And there appeared to him an angel of the Lord standing on the right side of the altar of incense. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Zechariah was troubled when he saw him, and fear fell upon him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.60"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "60",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But the angel said to him, “Do not be afraid, Zechariah, for your prayer is heard, and your wife Elizabeth will bear you a son, and you shall call his name John.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After these days his wife Elizabeth conceived, and for five months she hid herself, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.30.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 30.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 4.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Thus the Lord has done to me in the days when he looked on me, to take away my reproach among men.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the sixth month the angel Gabriel was sent from God to a city of Galilee named Nazareth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to a virgin betrothed to a man whose name was Joseph, of the house of David; and the virgin's name was Mary. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he came to her and said, “Hail, O favored one, the Lord is with you!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities add",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Blessed are you among women!”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But she was greatly troubled at the saying, and considered in her mind what sort of greeting this might be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And the angel said to her, “Do not be afraid, Mary, for you have found favor with God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 2.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 1.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And behold, you will conceive in your womb and bear a son, and you shall call his name Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days Mary arose and went with haste into the hill country, to a city of Judah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and she entered the house of Zechariah and greeted Elizabeth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when Elizabeth heard the greeting of Mary, the babe leaped in her womb; and Elizabeth was filled with the Holy Spirit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.27+LUK.11.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 11.27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and she exclaimed with a loud cry, “Blessed are you among women, and blessed is the fruit of your womb! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And why is this granted me, that the mother of my Lord should come to me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For behold, when the voice of your greeting came to my ears, the babe in my womb leaped for joy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And blessed is she who believed that there would be",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.45",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "believed, for there will be",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a fulfilment of what was spoken to her from the Lord.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.1+1SA.2.2+1SA.2.3+1SA.2.4+1SA.2.5+1SA.2.6+1SA.2.7+1SA.2.8+1SA.2.9+1SA.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2.1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And Mary said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
