    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the time came for Elizabeth to be delivered, and she gave birth to a son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And her neighbors and kinsfolk heard that the Lord had shown great mercy to her, and they rejoiced with her. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 12.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 17.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And on the eighth day they came to circumcise the child; and they would have named him Zechariah after his father, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but his mother said, “Not so; he shall be called John.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they said to her, “None of your kindred is called by this name.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they made signs to his father, inquiring what he would have him called. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And he asked for a writing tablet, and wrote, “His name is John.” And they all marveled. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And immediately his mouth was opened and his tongue loosed, and he spoke, blessing God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And fear came on all their neighbors. And all these things were talked about through all the hill country of Judea; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 1:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all who heard them laid them up in their hearts, saying, “What then will this child be?” For the hand of the Lord was with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.1.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.1.66"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
